        "result": "NEGATIVE - corroborates stage 1 across the whole swept reviewer-policy family",
        "result_detail": "Uncertainty beats model_score at equal (strictness, shift_budget) in 0 of 6 captures, across all 450 simulated reviewer policies. model_score is the best routing at every strictness and every budget on every capture.",
